RuntimeError: Newton reported a contact-buffer overflow at num_envs=32 during the rollout (step 600) (22 warnings). Contacts are being dropped and every number from this run would be measured on a scene where the hand cannot fully feel the object.

  nefc overflow - please increase njmax to 9896
